WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.229
- I wish more than anything that I could go back

00:00:02.229 --> 00:00:03.770
and redo my prom.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.353
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.590
- [Announcer] You are going to Buzzfeed Queer Prom.

00:00:12.847 --> 00:00:15.394
- Oh my God, this rainbow.

00:00:15.394 --> 00:00:17.977
(upbeat music)

00:00:18.475 --> 00:00:20.058
- [All] Queer prom!

00:00:20.073 --> 00:00:21.530
- [Woman Off Screen] This prom feels a ton gayer

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.213
than all of my other proms.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.500
- [Man Off Screen] This is my first time going to prom.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.903
I feel as though it's like, prom is for everybody.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.610
- I don't think I've ever felt this masculine

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.693
in my entire life.

00:00:33.903 --> 00:00:35.350
- [Woman Off Screen 2] I want them to look at me and say

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:36.300
she's a homosexual.

00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:38.840
- [Man Off Screen 2] I feel like I'm ready to have

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.333
a night I'll never forget.

00:00:41.063 --> 00:00:42.400
- [Woman Off Screen 3] It's not like, oh I'm just going

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.730
to prom to go to prom, it's going to prom to go to prom.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.470
- I think the one thing that I'm gonna take away

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.793
from Queer Prom this year was that, I'm normal.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.770
- I can honestly say for like, the first time in my life,

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:55.370
like, I actually feel beautiful.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.500
- To still be yourself and shine as bright

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.300
as all of the colors in our rainbow.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.310
- [Woman Off Screen 4] Everybody that's queer,

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.900
like, goes through the same kind of stuff

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.259
and that we have each other, no matter where we come from.

00:01:06.259 --> 00:01:07.092
- [Woman Off Screen 5] Don't be afraid

00:01:07.092 --> 00:01:08.190
to put yourself out there.

00:01:08.287 --> 00:01:09.980
- [Man Off Screen 3] Having gone through this experience

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:12.640
has definitely boosted my confidence and made me

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:13.623
feel more like me.

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:18.126
♪ Dance with me ♪

00:01:18.126 --> 00:01:22.656
♪ Let's do this thing tonight alright ♪

00:01:22.656 --> 00:01:26.485
♪ Come with me ♪

00:01:26.485 --> 00:01:30.512
♪ Step into the light ♪

00:01:30.512 --> 00:01:33.555
♪ Dance with me ♪

00:01:33.555 --> 00:01:38.055
♪ Let's do this thing tonight alright ♪

00:01:38.689 --> 00:01:41.189
